From 0b88b8e35aff030ec962078316554dc7484adf82 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 10:44:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 7/8] MIG-1 follow-up: read unselected embedded tapes through
 embedEmitCfg_unselected

The T3-factored bank lemmas emCall_bank_initial / emCall_bank_final cite the
published Turing.embedEmitCfg_unselected instead of the time-0 instance of
embedEmitTM_frame (which read runFrom 0 definitionally). CodeSimulator's
seam composition reads the copied seam's state through Cfg.ofWords_state.
